4N1DZJH6TCZP","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　みなさんも、ぜひイオンカードでお買い物をお楽しみくださいねー♪　　*☼*―――――*☼*―――――　　11/17(水)19:00〜日本テレビ『Best Artist2021』に櫻坂46が出演させて頂きます🎤　歌番組の出演、とても嬉しいです！頑張りますので是非観てくださいねー✨　　それではまた☺︎　"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHG45DBVKAJS08JFBEW197GK","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n　　　                                                     ゆっかー             "}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-11619":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは(*^-^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も1日お疲れちま＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/21/3352779/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は京都個別握手会でした!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来て下さったみなさん...\nありがとうございました*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"励ましの言葉をたくさん頂いて、\n焦らずゆっくり頑張ろうと思えました(´・ω・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとう＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんお気をつけてお帰りくださいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日来られなかったふぁみりーさんへのレポート*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は春色のお洋服＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/21/3352779/0002.png","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかに撮ってもらいました(*^-^*)\n謎のポーズ。。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして髪の毛にはオレンジのお花のピン☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hina.higuchi/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hina.higuchi/img/2013/04/21/3352779/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エアー握手♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"29日の横浜個別握手会でひなちまってるからねん(*´ω｀*)"},{"type":"br